### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### About check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/about

### Get all tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

### Get one existing ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T001

### Get missing ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T999

### Create a valid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot access printer",
  "description": "The office printer is showing paper jam errors even after clearing.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "ali@example.com"
}

### Create an invalid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}
